      "sourceTextSha256": "3add4a87309d4b42aa601aac563974ba49061cecb1200f7dcb237bf793e1b9b9",
      "text": "Day 2 · Breakfast, then a 4-hour tour: the cable car to Morro da Urca, with its wide observation deck, and on to Sugar Loaf, with views of Copacabana, the bay, the islands, the bridge to Niterói and Christ the Redeemer, then old Rio, with its historic churches, monasteries, Metropolitan Cathedral and colonial buildings. Rest in the afternoon before the big night.\n\nEvening · The Parade of Champions at the Sambadrome: the winning samba schools of Carnival 2027 parade once more, with their spectacular costumes and floats, in a joyful, festive night of music and dance. Transfer back to the hotel after the parade.",
